{"text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1926, \u00eentr-un sad din punjab. Tot\u0103lumea se uit\u0103 la Cer, dup\u0103 ploie, \u0219tiai c\u0103, cu un an \u00eenainte, prin ministul lindiei, acerut \u00eentrejit s\u0103-ri s\u0103 s-ar\u0103 peste o mas\u0103 pe s\u0103pt\u0103m\u00e2na, lal b\u0103hadur \u0219i astrii, r\u0103zboil \u0219i seceta, l\u0103sase r\u0103preapu\u021bine cereale. Uite ce ai \u00een farfurie, lipie, linte, poate ni\u0219te legume. \u00cen toat\u0103 india, \u00een care ajunge doar pentru ca am 2.000 de calorii de oampezii, un nou n\u0103scut de aici putea spera la vr\u0103 40 \u0219i 6 de ani. A\u0219a c\u0103 india import\u0103 din mecsic, obspre 10.000 de ton\u0103 de semin\u021be de gr\u0103u. Plant\u0103 scunde \u0219i resistente, create de echipa lui Norma in Borlaug. Au nevoie de ap\u0103 \u0219i de mult \u00eengra\u0219\u0103m\u00e2nd, facut \u00een fabric din azotul din aier. \u00cen c\u0103zva ani, recolta de gr\u0103u a indiei sare la 7-10 milioane de ton\u0103. Te\u0219tei \u00een care acum, destul\u0103, \u00eensf\u00e2r\u0219it. Produse la ton\u0103. Azi un nou n\u0103scut din india, poate spera la vr\u0103 70-2 de ani \u0219i peste tot \u00een lume, \u00een care n-a fost niciodat\u0103 mai din bel \u0219ug. Ce aci aduce o problem\u0103 complet nou\u0103?", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.46, "text": " Te treze\u0219ti \u00een anul 1926, \u00eentr-un sad din punjab.", "tokens": [50364, 1989, 2192, 1381, 10355, 7317, 15351, 364, 425, 1294, 10880, 11, 43990, 81, 12, 409, 4227, 3791, 4468, 73, 455, 13, 50606], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.43480129631198183, "compression_ratio": 1.4982698961937717, "no_speech_prob": 0.3001284599304199, "words": [{"word": " Te", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16, "probability": 0.21218997240066528}, {"word": " treze\u0219ti", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.62, "probability": 0.7675519809126854}, {"word": " \u00een", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.76, "probability": 0.48872995376586